    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "ad8b2a7a-5be9-5cea-9ebf-0bbd1680f9a1",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $A+(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A+(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3-2 & 3-0 \\\\ 2-(-1) & 5-(-3)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3+(-5) & 3+3 \\\\ 5+3 & 2+8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 6 \\\\ 8 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
