    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a584396b-a9f4-502a-a307-3c4f86207ce6",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $C+(D-E)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$D=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$C+(D-E)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}C+(D-E) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\left(\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -5 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\right) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-1-4 & 3-(-5) \\\\ -2-1 & 4-5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 8 \\\\ -3 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5+(-5) & -1+8 \\\\ 5+(-3) & -4+(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 & 7 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
